%% Trace: BR-01–BR-14; SC-01–SC-08
%% Scope: Repository ownership; packages below service roots are responsibilities, not a claim that handlers already exist.
%% Legend: Two business services. Domain logic depends on interfaces, not UI/provider SDKs. No shared permission implementation or cross-database repositories.
flowchart LR
    Web["apps/web/<br/>UI candidate: React + Vite<br/>Consumes public facade; no authority"]
    Contracts["contracts/<br/>HTTP/event/data definitions<br/>Shared shape, not copied policy rules"]
    Workspace["services/workspace/<br/>Sessions, membership, Scrum, policy, gateway<br/>Own adapters + domain + local audit"]
    Knowledge["services/knowledge/<br/>Documents, retrieval, evidence and provenance<br/>Own adapters + domain + local audit"]
    Checks["scripts/ + tests/ + eval/<br/>Existing context/storage harness<br/>Future handler/contract/race tests"]
    Infra["infra/postgres/<br/>Compose/bootstrap + migration runner<br/>Separate store credentials"]
    Web -->|"public request/response shape"| Contracts
    Workspace -->|"owns Workspace API; consumes Knowledge API"| Contracts
    Knowledge -->|"owns Knowledge API; consumes current policy/state"| Contracts
    Checks -->|"contract/context validation"| Contracts
    Workspace -->|"owned migrations only"| Infra
    Knowledge -->|"owned migrations only"| Infra
